  "limitations": [
    "Examples validate adapter semantics only; they do not validate national forms, CAP eligibility, real farmer time savings or source representativeness.",
    "The CLI writes reviewable CSV only. Import metadata maps source columns explicitly, and a person supplies typed value_json/provenance when promoting an import row into a proposed fact.",
